{"version":1,"content":"<p>世界氣象組織在最新季節氣候展望發佈會上發出警告稱，當前厄爾尼諾事件的強度可能達到前所未有的水平，甚至超出了過去40年來相關監測圖表的範圍。該現象預計將在2026年底前後達到峯值，但其影響將在此後持續相當長時間，對全球天氣格局產生深遠影響。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583564.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.753555+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:33:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"12e960a886bbf6214e19840747ef4fcf49891d7fc4d0c7c7942830c2c22c0ee7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}